{"id":"n36559-1-7","stage":4,"title":"구사일생 · 九死一生","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36559-1-7-1","ko":"아랫집 아기가 창문에서 떨어졌는데 나무에 걸려서 살았대요.","zh":"楼下的小孩从窗户掉下来了，不过挂在树上，所以才保住了性命。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아랫집","meaning":"下家邻居","explanation":"아랫집：下家邻居。","readings":[{"term":"아랫집","audio":"/audio/553c5b006533f2da9b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66798","senseId":"1","lemma":"아랫집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아랫집","audio":"/audio/553c5b006533f2da9b27.mp3"}},{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아기가","audio":"/audio/26e60641381a50692ff7.mp3"}},{"text":"창문에서","meaning":"窗，窗户","explanation":"창문：窗，窗户；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"창문","audio":"/audio/13938495269cab67783e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71809","senseId":"1","lemma":"창문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"창문에서","audio":"/audio/3adaa359cfcd5fc72e94.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어졌는데","meaning":"掉，下降","explanation":"떨어지다：掉，下降；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어졌는데","audio":"/audio/ced285485368d66f3184.mp3"}},{"text":"나무에","meaning":"树，树木","explanation":"나무：树，树木；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32750","senseId":"1","lemma":"나무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나무에","audio":"/audio/d85077cae3dd99e8b044.mp3"}},{"text":"걸려서","meaning":"被挂","explanation":"걸리다：被挂；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"1","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸려서","audio":"/audio/78c87e4c8b27674bc627.mp3"}},{"text":"살았대요.","meaning":"活，活着，生存","explanation":"살다：活，活着，生存；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"1","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살았대요","audio":"/audio/1acbad92286ef86a22ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"553c5b006533f2da","term":"아랫집","zh":"下家邻居","audio":"/audio/553c5b006533f2da9b27.mp3","entryId":"66798","definition":"在下方为邻或在低处的房子。","pronunciation":["아래찝","아랟찝"]},{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"13938495269cab67","term":"창문","zh":"窗，窗户","audio":"/audio/13938495269cab67783e.mp3","entryId":"71809","definition":"做在墙壁或屋顶上的、用来通风或采光的门。","pronunciation":["창문"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"掉，下降","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"由上往下落。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"b294b251f77dfbc5","term":"나무","zh":"树，树木","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3","entryId":"32750","definition":"拥有坚硬的茎杆，上面长有枝叶的多年生植物。","pronunciation":["나무"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"被挂","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"为了避免掉落，物体被吊挂在某处。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"活，活着，生存","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"存有生命。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bbbeae40ffa02621931e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n36559-1-7-2","ko":"정말 구사일생으로 목숨을 건졌네요!","zh":"真是千钧一发，才侥幸逃过一劫啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sou